------------------------------------------------------------------------

The published container images bundle the following third-party software.
Each remains under its own licence; the combination is redistributable
because every licence below is compatible with Apache-2.0.

  OpenCode                     MIT          https://github.com/sst/opencode
  llama.cpp / llama-server     MIT          https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp
  Go toolchain                 BSD-3-Clause https://go.dev
  Node.js                      MIT          https://nodejs.org
  bubblewrap                   LGPL-2.1+    https://github.com/containers/bubblewrap
